    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Vincent Walsh Auctioneers are proud to present a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a quiet, elevated setting with excellent connectivity to surrounding towns and Galway City.\r\n\r\nThis 4 bedroom detached house sitting on a landscaped site located at Mile Hill, Ballinrobe, Co. Mayo. Constructed circa 2005/06, this well-proportioned family home extends to approximately 1,979 sq. ft. (184 sq. m) and offers spacious accommodation over two floors, together with a generous garden area, tarmacadam driveway and a wooden shed.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, the welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious sitting room, while the heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area. The kitchen features shaker-style fitted units and integrated/electric appliances, with sliding glass doors providing access to the rear garden. The ground floor also benefits from a separate family room with open fireplace, guest WC and utility back hall.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four bedrooms, three of which benefit from built-in wardrobes. The principal bedroom includes an ensuite shower room, while the main family bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath and electric shower. Attic access is also provided from the landing.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated at Mile Hill, approximately 3.5 km from Ballinrobe, offering convenient access to the town's excellent range of shops, schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and services. Cong Village is a mere 7.7 km aqway while Headford is approximately 18 km, Castlebar approximately 31 km, while Galway City is approximately 44 km from the property.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious detached family home on a generous site in a sought-after rural location, while remaining within easy commuting distance of Castlebar and Galway.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through Vincent Walsh Auctioneers, we remain ultra flexible around viewings. PLEASE NOTE VIEWINGS ARE STRICTLY PRIVATE BY APPOINTMENT ONLY IN THE COMPANY OF THE AUCTIONEER MR VINCENT WALSH.\r\n\r\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither Vincent Walsh Auctioneer nor the vendor accepts any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Vincent Walsh Auctioneer has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
